                <note rend="inline" type="source">493.11/1617: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Consul General at
                        Shanghai (Cunningham)</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1932-03-16T18:00:00-05:00">March 16, 1932—6 p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>102. For the Minister. Your March 15, 5 p.m., penultimate sentence. Department
                    approves.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Stimson</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
